---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "Peer-reviewed publications by Mahan Balooei.",
	title: "Publications",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">Publications</h1>

	<section>
		<article>
			<h2 class="text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg">
				Mechanism-based Targeting of Lactate Dehydrogenase Tetramerization Process through
				Natural Derived Compounds: A Survey of Molecular Docking, Molecular Dynamics, and QSAR
				Analysis
			</h2>
			<p class="text-muted mt-2 text-sm">
				Farmani, S., Dehghanbanadaki, N.,
				<strong class="text-global-text">Balooei, M.</strong> (equal-contributing author), Mehralitabar,
				H., Sabaghian, H., &amp; Naderi-Manesh, H.
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted mt-1 text-sm">
				<em>Computers in Biology and Medicine</em>, 197, 111000 (2025)
			</p>
			<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus mt-3 max-w-none">
				<p>
					Screened approximately 5,000 naturally derived compounds against four LDH
					tetramerization interfaces, evaluating top candidates through molecular docking,
					100-ns molecular dynamics simulations, and downstream structural and dynamics
					analysis, and identifying candidate modulators of the tetramerization interfaces.
				</p>
			</div>
			<a
				class="cactus-link mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold"
				href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compbiomed.2025.111000"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				Paper →
			</a>
		</article>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
